    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>5. Integration Summary</h2>
<p>By appending this addendum to the base report, the engineering team maintains the sound 10-step evaluation framework while ensuring full architectural readiness for all 6 Grooveli AI Studio product modules.</p>

